e8", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_command_aura", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·复仇光环", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit's presence increases the damage of nearby friendly heroes. Vengeful Spirit herself receives %self_multiplier%%% extra bonus.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the damage aura."], "scepter_loc": "Increases self multiplier. Upon death, creates a strong illusion of Vengeful Spirit that deals full damage, and can cast all of her spells. If the illusion is alive when Vengeful Spirit respawn, she will take its place. XP earned by her illusion is given to her. Strong Illusions are not instantly killed by spells."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit's presence increases the damage of nearby friendly heroes. Vengeful Spirit herself receives %self_multiplier%%% extra bonus.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the damage aura."], "scepter_loc": "Increases self multiplier. Upon death, creates a strong illusion of Vengeful Spirit that deals full damage, and can cast all of her spells. If the illusion is alive when Vengeful Spirit respawn, she will take its place. XP earned by her illusion is given to her. Strong Illusions are not instantly killed by spells."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "scepter_illusion_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": [100], "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "2bb2957a13800a64130c", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6fdf3646843d47e342a8", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a74ee62f96b937e6ac72", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "388c845ff979020a8fcc", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "13f5d1790ed82c78c663", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "2faa5b9b82d0e0499db4", "mechanism": "illusions", "mechanism_zh": "幻象", "definition": "制造自身或他人的幻象", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e2d9624208fd3ed9e232", "mechanism": "respawn", "mechanism_zh": "重生", "definition": "死亡后复活，或影响复活", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_retribution", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·恶有恶报", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit is considered both a ranged and a melee attacker to gain the respective bonuses. When killed by an enemy hero, Vengeful Spirit deals %bonus_damage%%% bonus damage to her killer until their next death. Only one debuff can exist at a time."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit is considered both a ranged and a melee attacker to gain the respective bonuses. When killed by an enemy hero, Vengeful Spirit deals %bonus_damage%%% bonus damage to her killer until their next death. Only one debuff can exist at a time.", "notes_loc": ["When attacking units with Pip Health, Vengeful Spirit is considered a ranged attacker."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "418bc9d4de9b63fc828f", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:vengefulspirit_retribution:incoming_damage_amp:base", "mechanism": "incoming_damage_amp", "mechanism_zh": "伤害加深", "definition": "让目标受到更多物理伤害或全部伤害（只加深魔法的归上一项）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_wave_of_terror", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·恐怖波动", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit lets loose a wicked cry, weakening the total attack damage and armor of enemies, and giving vision of the path ahead."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Vengeful Spirit lets loose a wicked cry, weakening the total attack damage and armor of enemies, and giving vision of the path ahead."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [40], "new": [50]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "d09179bc99090c501e44", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "9f3d273e198692622717", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "27d2eac84ada77cd5976", "mechanism": "attack_damage_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减攻击力", "definition": "降低目标的攻击力", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0917161df0d192bd8f2b", "mechanism": "grant_vision", "mechanism_zh": "提供视野", "definition": "提供目标或区域的视野", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "venomancer_noxious_plague", "name_zh": "剧毒术士·恶性瘟疫", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Infects an enemy with a plague that does damage on application then slows the target and deals damage over time based on their maximum health. When the debuff ends for any reason, all debuffs from Venomancer on the initial target and the plague are spread to nearby targets. Additional spreads beyond the first do not deal impact damage.", "notes_loc": ["Spread debuffs have fixed duration and are not modified by status resistance or debuff amplification."], "scepter_loc": "Decreases cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown% seconds. Infected units have decreased magic resistance. Additional spreads from hero targets deal full impact damage."}, "text_742": {"de