The ward is immune to magic. Ward attacks apply Venomancer's Poison Sting with %poison_sting_potency%%% damage/slow.", "notes_loc": ["Poison Sting from a plague ward fully stacks with Poison Sting from Venomancer."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "poison_sting_potency", "old": null, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "82175dfb9dbdf2c127f7", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:venomancer_plague_ward:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0a8342efa27a8a549210", "mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "mechanism_zh": "减益免疫/技能免疫", "definition": "处于减益免疫（技能免疫）时，只有能无视减益免疫的效果才对其生效（如碎颅锤的重击可以眩晕开了黑皇杖的单位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:venomancer_plague_ward:slow:base", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a5b1044c371b677bbca6", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "d1fa089c27d08ad4bb85", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "venomancer_snakebite", "name_zh": "剧毒术士·毒蛇撕咬", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Venomancer summons a Spawn of Aktok to sink its fangs into a target, dealing magic damage and applying a toxin that does damage every second. When the target attacks while infected, they take the initial damage again."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Venomancer summons a Spawn of Aktok to sink its fangs into a target, dealing magic damage and applying a toxin that does damage every second. When the target attacks while infected, they take the initial damage again."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [600], "new": [600, 650, 700, 750]}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [600], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [600, 650, 700, 750], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "744d26f68ebec4f1e4a0", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "51e1396eee3671eb9765", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "2ed6da092266d3ef89a6", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "viper_nethertoxin", "name_zh": "冥界亚龙·幽冥剧毒", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Viper releases a Nethertoxin at the targeted area. Units in that area take an increasing damage over time based on how long they remain in it. Units in it have their attack speed slowed.", "notes_loc": ["Multiple Nethertoxins do not stack."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Viper releases a Nethertoxin at the targeted area. Units in that area take an increasing damage over time based on how long they remain in it. Units in it have their attack speed slowed.", "notes_loc": ["Multiple Nethertoxins do not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "924e072eb07c686cd442", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "858efabe317daf135b8f", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:viper_nethertoxin:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "viper_predator", "name_zh": "冥界亚龙·掠食", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Viper's attacks deal an additional instance of physical damage per missing health percentage of the target hero."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Viper's attacks deal an additional instance of physical damage per missing health percentage of the target hero."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage", "old": {"base": [0.25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [0.24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:viper_predator:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "419a44bd81575085b91a", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "visage_grave_chill", "name_zh": "维萨吉·黄泉颤抖", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Visage drains the movement and attack speed of the targeted unit, gaining the drained speed for itself and nearby Familiars.", "notes_loc": ["The two buffs can be removed separately by dispels.", "The speed gained is independent of the speed lost on the target.", "Familiars within %radius% range of Visage will also receive bonuses from Grave Chill."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Visage drains the movement and attack speed of the targeted unit, gaining the drained speed for itself and nearby Familiars.", "notes_loc": ["The two buffs can be removed separately by dispels.", "The speed gained is independent of the speed lost on the target.", "Familiars within %radius% range of Visage will also receive bonuses from Grave Chill."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "attackspeed_bonus", "old": {"base": [35, 45, 55, 65], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40, 50, 60, 70], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:visage_grave_chill:attack_slow:base", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "87c46b19f97932cbfa7c", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:visage_grave_chill:slow:base", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f55e17f0341a3ff58ca7", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "vladmir", "name_zh": "弗拉迪米尔的祭品", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Vladmir's Aura Grants %lifesteal_aura%%% lifesteal, %damage_aura%%% bonus damage, %mana_regen_aura% mana regeneration, and %armor_aura% armor to nearby allies. Radius: %aura_radius%", "notes_loc": ["Lifesteal on attacks against creeps is reduced to %lifesteal_creeps_tooltip%%%."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Vladmir's Aura Grants %lifesteal_aura%%% lifesteal, %damage_aura%%% bonus damage, %mana_regen_aura% mana regeneration, and %armor_aura% armor to nearby allies. Radius: %aura_radius%", "notes_loc": ["Lifesteal on attacks against creeps is reduced to %lifesteal_creeps_tooltip%%%."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "armor", "old": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "armor_aura", "old": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5ec739842b514e21e714", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "5c6453f78d425bb40184", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a40778cb9e5e9c264123", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f99bae0ad6d088700d2a", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e4bb2291846edf12e915", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_astral_step", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·太虚之径", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit tears a rift through the astral plane to appear at the target location, attacking all enemies along the path. This attack inflicts a void mark that slows for %pop_damage_delay% seconds and then detonates.", "notes_loc": ["Astral Step attacks do not cleave."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit tears a rift through the astral plane to appear at the target location, attacking all enemies along the path with bonus item potency. This attack inflicts a void mark that slows for %pop_damage_delay% seconds and then detonates.", "notes_loc": ["Astral Step attacks do not cleave."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_potency", "old": null, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "014fd73c74259f66ed0b", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:void_spirit_astral_step:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "47597754feb8bc9ee512", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "cb85b41a1ce11d8308db", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:void_spirit_astral_step:self_mobility:base", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "6158f65495cc94ac218d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_dissimilate", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·异化", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit temporarily fades into the aether, creating a number of portals through which he can reassemble himself. Upon exiting a portal, he damages all enemies in the area.", "facets_loc": ["Upon exiting Dissimilate, Aether Remnants are created at the %aether_remnant_count% portals furthest from Void Spirit. No effect if reassembling from the center portal. Remnants face towards the center portal and have reduced pull duration and damage."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit temporarily fades into the aether, creating a number of portals through which he can reassemble himself. Upon exiting a portal, he damages all enemies in the area.", "facets_loc": ["Upon exiting Dissimilate, Aether Remnants are created at the %aether_remnant_count% portals furthest from Void Spirit. No effect if reassembling from the center portal. Remnants face towards the center portal and have reduced pull duration and damage."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [120], "new": [110]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [120], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [110], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "25b02b6e43c620086fa6", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:void_spirit_dissimilate:invulnerable_untargetable:base", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:void_spirit_dissimilate:self_mobility:base", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_intrinsic_edge", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·内在优势", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit gains %damage_stat_bonus_pct%%% more attack damage per point of each attribute, and %secondary_stat_bonus_pct%%% more HP regen from Strength, attack speed from Agility, and mana regen from Intelligence."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit gains %damage_stat_bonus_pct%%% more attack damage per point of each attribute, and %secondary_stat_bonus_pct%%% more HP regen from Strength, attack speed from Agility, and mana regen from Intelligence."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "4406636445698", "new": "567356589867011"}], "rows": [{"review_id": "5133f1d8c4340e62e79c", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "d5236cfcc4951e23ed90", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "11f19e747fc80a9eeec2", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "void_spirit_resonant_pulse", "name_zh": "虚无之灵·共鸣脉冲", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit wraps himself in a protective shield that absorbs physical damage and emits a single damaging pulse around him. The shield gains increased damage absorption for each enemy hero the pulse hits.", "scepter_loc": "Causes Resonant Pulse to silence and gain %max_charges% charges.", "facets_loc": ["Resonant Pulse creates a larger all damage barrier instead of a physical barrier."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Void Spirit wraps himself in a protective shield that absorbs physical damage and emits a single damaging pulse around him. The shield gains increased damage absorption for each enemy hero the pulse hits.", "scepter_loc": "Causes Resonant Pulse to silence and gain %max_charges% charges.", "facets_loc": ["Resonant Pulse creates a larger all damage barrier instead of a physical barrier."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "base_absorb_amount", "old": {"base": [25, 50, 75, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [40, 60, 80, 100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "20ecad62a5d058b5dbad", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0f2c9e3fa3e95847040f", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "21a3f725cef95ebc8ad8", "mechanism": "damage_block", "mechanism_zh": "护盾/伤害吸收/减伤", "definition": "吸收一定伤害、按比例减少受到的伤害，或把受到的伤害延迟结算（如统帅朗姆酒、虚妄之诺）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ae23c8c5ece072f16476", "mechanism": "silence", "mechanism_zh": "沉默", "definition": "目标无法施放技能（仍可攻击、使用物品）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "warlock_shadow_word", "name_zh": "术士·暗言术", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Warlock whi