ws stronger as it's channeled. Lasts up to %abilitychanneltime% seconds. Enemies are slowed for %duration% second after leaving the area or the spell ends.", "notes_loc": ["The slow increase is based on length of the channel, not the duration an enemy was standing in the area."], "shard_loc": "While channeling, Warlock spawns a minor imp every %imps_interval% seconds that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes dealing damage to all enemies around them upon death."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "CHANNELED - A powerful slowing and damaging current that grows stronger as it's channeled. Lasts up to %abilitychanneltime% seconds. Enemies are slowed for %duration% second after leaving the area or the spell ends.", "notes_loc": ["The slow increase is based on length of the channel, not the duration an enemy was standing in the area."], "shard_loc": "While channeling, Warlock spawns a minor imp every %imps_interval% seconds that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes dealing damage to all enemies around them upon death."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "891ee3bf901d6edb8f21", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:warlock_upheaval:aoe_damage:base", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "4698c47ede2b729b1bea", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "cfa044bdf5c41b6923a2", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:warlock_upheaval:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "c